name issue_23_outage_500ms
describe 0.5 s outage on a 2 Mbps link: one keyframe is enough (Tester run 4 on #23: v1 asked for 6-8)
# Issue #23 (partial): libwebrtc asks for 0-1 keyframes here.
# Target (issue #23): within 2x of libwebrtc or within 2 requests, without raising video.longest_freeze_ms.
duration 30s
at 0s  capacity=2000kbps delay=20ms queue=300ms
at 10s down
at 10.5s up
reverse at 0s delay=20ms
reverse at 10s down
reverse at 10.5s up
expect video.keyframe_requests <= 2
# Freezes under v2 (seeds 1-5 worst case 2075 ms total, 1467 ms longest) are WORSE than v1 and than libwebrtc; the expect lines below lock the level reached so
# it cannot get worse. Target (issue #23): not above v1 (longest freeze unmeasured on v1 here), libwebrtc: unmeasured. Needs the Owner's sign-off (PR label needs-human).
expect video.freeze_total_ms < 2500
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 1800
